<title>EU: EP APPROVES PROPOSALS ON ASSISTANCE TO BULGARIA, MACEDONIA.</title>
<headline>EP APPROVES PROPOSALS ON ASSISTANCE TO BULGARIA, MACEDONIA.</headline>
<text>
<p>EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT SESSION NEWS PRESS RELEASE</p>
<p>DOCUMENT DATE: JUNE 13, 1997</p>
<p>*</p>
<p>Macro-financial assistance to Bulgaria and the Former</p>
<p>Republic of Macedonia</p>
<p>*</p>
<p>Friday, 13 June - The proposals for Council decisions providing macro financial assistance to Bulgaria and the Former Republic of Macedonia were carried without amendments. END OF DOCUMENT</p>
</text>
